# ── Frontend configuration (Vite) ────────────────────────────────────────
# Vite variables are BUILD-TIME: their values are baked into the bundle by
# `npm run build`. Changing one means rebuilding. Only the VITE_ prefix is
# exposed to the browser. Copy this file to `.env` (or `.env.production`) if you
# need it.

# Base address of the backend API. LEAVE EMPTY for a single-domain deployment
# (Nginx proxying /api) or during development (the Vite proxy). Fill it in ONLY
# when the frontend and backend are on different origins.
#
#   Default (empty)              → /api/v1        (relative; needs /api proxied to the backend)
#   Frontend and backend split   → https://api.example.com/api/v1
#
# Note: when set to an absolute URL, asset URLs (/uploads/...) automatically use
# the origin from VITE_API_URL — see src/lib/api.ts → assetUrl.
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.example.com/api/v1
